<title>USA: Kansas feedlot cattle market at standstill - USDA.</title>
<headline>Kansas feedlot cattle market at standstill - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DODGE CITY 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trade was quiet, with no sales slaughter steers or heifers confirmed, USDA said. Inquiry good, demand light.</p>
<p>Sales confirmed for the week to date on 10,100 cattle including 6,500 head or about 64 percent previously contracted or formulated sales.</p>
<p>Confirmed -    none  last week - 19,200  last week -  2,000</p>
<p>Wk to date - 10,100  last week - 36,300  last week - 58,300</p>
<p>(Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8720)</p>
</text>
